{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45116","headline":"同李着作纵题尘外上人院 · 皎然","name":"同李着作纵题尘外上人院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百缘唯有什公瓶，万法但看一字经。\n从遣鸟喧心不动，任教香醉境常冥。\n莲花天昼浮云卷，贝叶宫春好月停。\n禅伴欲邀何着作，空音宜向夜中听。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45116.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45116","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}